{"id":"activite_","lemma":"activité","pos":"noun","rank":2098,"glosses":["activity (something to do for educational, recreational, or other purposes)","activity, hustle and bustle","occupation, profession, job, work"],"ipa":"/ak.ti.vi.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a5/Fr-activit%C3%A9.ogg/Fr-activit%C3%A9.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"activités"},"formAudio":{"activités":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-activit%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La ville était pleine d'activité.","en":"The town was full of activity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/27928","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"town, city"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"full, full up","l":"plein"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Marcher est une excellente activité.","en":"Walking is an excellent exercise.","words":[{"g":"to walk"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"excellent","l":"excellent"},null]},{"text":"Regarder la télé est une activité passive.","en":"Watching TV is a passive activity.","words":[{"g":"to look at"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"TV, telly"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"passive","l":"passif"}]},{"text":"Il y avait toutes sortes d'activités de groupe.","en":"There were all sorts of group activities.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"sort, kind, type","l":"sorte"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"group"}]},{"text":"Mon activité repart à nouveau.","en":"My business is picking up again.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to leave again","l":"repartir"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"once more"]]}]}